<title>USA: Odetics ATL unit files for offering.</title>
<headline>Odetics ATL unit files for offering.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Odetics Inc said ATL Products Inc, its wholly owned unit, has filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission covering an initial public offering of 1,650,000 shares of its Common Stock.</p>
<p>The offering price is expected to be between $10.00 and $12.00 per share.</p>
<p>Montgomery Securities and Cruttenden Roth Incorporated will manage the underwriting group.</p>
</text>
